<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: hippopotamus leather -->
  <AEXP_Leather_Hippopotamus.label>河马皮</AEXP_Leather_Hippopotamus.label>
  <!-- EN: A thick leather of a hippopotamus. Not only it's extremely durable, but it also provides considerable heat insulation. -->
  <AEXP_Leather_Hippopotamus.description>河马的极厚皮，不仅坚韧、耐用，隔温能力也良好。</AEXP_Leather_Hippopotamus.description>
  <AEXP_Leather_Hippopotamus.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>河马皮</AEXP_Leather_Hippopotamus.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>
  
  <!-- EN: pinniped leather -->
  <AEXP_Leather_Pinniped.label>鳍足动物皮</AEXP_Leather_Pinniped.label>
  <!-- EN: Tanned and dried leather from a Pinniped. It is of average strength but insulates well against heat. -->
  <AEXP_Leather_Pinniped.description>鞣制过的鳍足动物皮，强度适中，隔温能力出色。</AEXP_Leather_Pinniped.description>
  <AEXP_Leather_Pinniped.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>鳍足动物皮</AEXP_Leather_Pinniped.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>
  
  <!-- EN: tiger leather -->
  <AEXP_Leather_Tiger.label>虎皮</AEXP_Leather_Tiger.label>
  <!-- EN: Tigers were often the target of poachers in old Earth due to their luxurious pelts, a fact that almost drove them to extinction. With the near lawlessness of the Rim, tiger leather is seen as another exotic commodity to trade between settlements. -->
  <AEXP_Leather_Tiger.description>老虎是旧地球上偷猎者的老目标了，因它们的皮毛奢华而珍贵，差点也因此而灭绝。在边缘世界这种无法之地里，殖民地之间的虎皮贸易更为猖獗。</AEXP_Leather_Tiger.description>
  <AEXP_Leather_Tiger.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>虎皮</AEXP_Leather_Tiger.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>
  
  <!-- EN: musk ox wool -->
  <AEXP_MuskOxWool.label>麝牛毛</AEXP_MuskOxWool.label>
  <!-- EN: The inner wool of the muskox, originally known in Inuktitut as Qiviuq. Stronger and warmer than sheep's wool, and softer than cashmere wool. -->
  <AEXP_MuskOxWool.description>麝牛的内层毛，比绵羊毛暖，比山羊绒软。</AEXP_MuskOxWool.description>
  <AEXP_MuskOxWool.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>麝牛毛</AEXP_MuskOxWool.stuffProps.stuffAdjective>
  
</LanguageData>